{"aliases":[],"ancestry":{"derived_from":[],"mutation_dimensions":["capacity_limit","stacking_rules","weight_system","container_nesting"],"observed_in":["cross-game design analysis"],"source_games":["broguece","cataclysm-bn","crawl","nethack"]},"concept_type":"design_primitive","concrete_examples":[{"description":"In NetHack, players have a limited inventory space, requiring strategic decisions about which items to keep or discard. The game features various item types, each with different effects and utilities, prompting players to prioritize based on their current situation and future needs.","game":"nethack","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7e5b-a659-dc0465421413","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1075-7dbf-a51b-c713e9c26615","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-787f-a72b-53ecd0e67e57","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7316-97a8-fb33968a55b8","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7a18-8a2f-a0684b6dd106","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-77be-843d-023b929be9dd","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7bac-b269-41b82a62a658","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-71d0-97c3-a2ceb6107f64","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7b6a-99c6-85f213529fdf","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7ff5-afc2-a68c3bd836c0"],"source_file":""},{"description":"In Broguece, players have a limited number of inventory slots, requiring them to make strategic choices about which items to keep for combat, healing, or exploration. This limitation creates tension as players must balance the need for versatile equipment against the temptation to collect numerous loot items during their journey.","game":"broguece","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-026c-7e6b-a036-cc9dd7a859a5","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-025c-75eb-b046-a0b5cd3e87bb","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-023c-789f-bd54-277b32f37159","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-028a-7100-8af6-9a3e238ca420","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-024c-7412-862b-36d68113563a","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-027a-7936-99c7-68edf2b50bc9","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-06a6-73c4-bcac-c0970a8b1ab7","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-06fe-7858-9371-82d74a3a6fe5","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-0696-73fd-b04c-7b80a542e6d4","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-0675-7969-a039-2a57a21f89ac"],"source_file":""},{"description":"In 'crawl', players have a limited number of inventory slots which forces them to make strategic decisions about which items to keep, such as weapons, potions, and scrolls, while considering their current situation and future exploration needs. This management of inventory is crucial for survival, as players must balance carrying useful items against the risk of overburdening themselves and being unable to pick up valuable loot.","game":"crawl","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a72-74a4-8962-8d61a1317e1b","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7745-b3c2-b24ff2995f17","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7bf4-84f7-ae3813bb6241","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7aaa-80b1-2cd349ffd2c2","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7c8e-b1bc-720ff47def0c","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7a40-ab6e-9d85e37def5c","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7fad-9b7d-19d73db8446d","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7987-aa24-664adba3c28b","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7498-9e41-1cedcf8e37a4","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7265-b422-f981fd55aeef"],"source_file":""},{"description":"In cataclysm-bn, inventory management is implemented through a grid-based system where players can only carry a limited amount of items based on their character's strength and the weight of the items. Players must make strategic decisions about what to keep, such as prioritizing essential supplies for survival while discarding less useful items to make space for new loot.","game":"cataclysm-bn","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-93e6-7d76-8a62-0c00d958261e","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-936f-77e3-b9b7-31cebfa4ca49","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9369-7018-87e4-535b2cb62e88","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-936a-705d-9b02-00ef9b639ffe","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9369-77e0-b136-47ce32a0f19f","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9369-7bbf-87e3-bb3cdef54543","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9369-70d0-b620-12cd1a9db111","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9383-7b9e-a88b-2c039449eb33","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-936c-77c8-97e2-06fc99a53412","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-949d-7f37-8c07-6213e7e3e2d0"],"source_file":""}],"decision_refs":[],"definition":"A game system where players must manage limited inventory space, creating strategic decisions about what to carry, what to discard, and what to prioritize. Inventory constraints create tension between exploration preparedness and loot acquisition.","epistemic":{"confidence":"inferred","status":"observed"},"evidence_refs":[],"exclusion_criteria":["Unlimited inventory with no capacity constraints","Inventory that is purely cosmetic without gameplay impact","Crafting-only systems without carry limits"],"id":"urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a03266-9750-712c-9b75-5f7ca75420ec","implementation_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7e5b-a659-dc0465421413","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1075-7dbf-a51b-c713e9c26615","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-787f-a72b-53ecd0e67e57","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7316-97a8-fb33968a55b8","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7a18-8a2f-a0684b6dd106","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-77be-843d-023b929be9dd","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7bac-b269-41b82a62a658","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-71d0-97c3-a2ceb6107f64","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7b6a-99